Network Stability:
------------------
Maintained

Unknown Unicast Flooding:
-------------------------
Contained

Summary
=======

Problem:
Excessive Unknown Unicast traffic can flood the network and consume bandwidth.

Solution:
Unknown Unicast Storm Control limits the amount of Unknown Unicast traffic allowed on a switch port.

Benefit:
Protects network resources and helps mitigate CAM Table Overflow-related flooding.

Limitation:
Does not remove the source of the attack.

